### Drill 1: Admin Migration
# Run migrations and initialize schema
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/migrate

### Drill 2: Connection Management & Health
# Verify database connectivity and latency
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Drill 3: Repository Pattern (User CRUD)
# Create a new user
# @name createUser
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "advanced_user@example.com"
}

### List all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Drill 4: Transaction Management (Project + Tasks)
# Atomic creation of a project and its associated tasks
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Advanced Architecture Project",
  "tasks": [
    "Design Repository Pattern",
    "Implement Transaction Wrapper",
    "Add Health Check Endpoint"
  ]
}

### Test Transaction Rollback
# Should fail because of empty task title, and no project should be created
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Failed Project",
  "tasks": [
    "Valid Task",
    ""
  ]
}

### Drill 5: Slow Query Simulation
# Observe the console for [SLOW QUERY] logs (>100ms)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/slow
